timeline
    title England's History Timeline
    section Stone Age
        7600 BC : Britain's oldest known house was built in Orkney
        6000 BC : Sea levels rise and Britain becomes an island
    section Bronze Age
        2300 BC : People arrive from Europe and settle in Britain
        2200 BC : Last major building works at Stonehenge
    section Iron Age
        600 BC : Iron tools and weapons become common
        50 BC : Roman conquest begins
